    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Murphy Mullan Goatstown are delighted to present 5 Brabazon Hall, a two-bedroom townhouse with living areas arranged over two floors. Presented in turnkey condition throughout, it benefits from new flooring and carpets, a top-floor balcony and secure underground parking.\r\n\r\nThe bright top-floor living space is the heart of the home. A large rooflight draws daylight into the open-plan lounge and kitchen, including a breakfast bar. A huge storage room off the kitchen gives you a handy place for additional storage. The dual aspect future ensures consistent natural light throughout the day, Step onto the balcony for a morning coffee or a moment of fresh air at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nOn the middle floor, both bedrooms have built-in wardrobes and new carpets, and one has an en-suite shower room. A separate bathroom includes a bath with an overhead shower.\r\n\r\nThe property extends to 80sqm and secure underground parking adds everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nSet on Ardee Street, just off Cork Street, Brabazon Hall puts the cafés, shops and character of the Liberties close by. Dublin city centre is within walking distance, with nearby bus and Luas connections for trips further afield.\r\nViewing highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "*Turn key condition\r\n*Secure underground parking.\r\n*Generous storage.\r\n*Open plan living/kitchen.\r\n*Dual aspect.\r\n*Excellent transport links.\r\n*Walking distance to city centre."
      },
      {
